      "count_explanation": "RECON_9120 gives 16 El Nino events over 1950-2023 using a fixed 1991-2020 monthly climatology and a 3-month centred running mean; CPC ONI gives 22 events over its available record (Jan 1950 to Jul 2026). The difference is expected because (i) ONI uses its own published rolling 30-year centred normal rather than the fixed 1991-2020 baseline of RECON_9120; (ii) ONI is distributed at coarse precision relative to the raw ERSST-derived reconstruction; and (iii) the centred running mean has no values at 1950-01 or 2023-12 for RECON_9120, whereas ONI starts at DJF 1950 (centred Jan 1950) and ends at JJA 2026 (centred Jul 2026). Events straddling those record edges are therefore truncated or absent in one series but not the other.",
